---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section class="section" id="pipeline" style="text-align:center">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Pipelines</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">Chain dependent agents into a DAG — outputs flow downstream, fan-out and fan-in resolve automatically, and the web UI renders the live graph.</p>
    <img src={`${base}media/web-pipeline.png`} alt="A multi-stage agent pipeline rendered as a DAG in the warden web UI: parallel roots fan out through design and implementation jobs and converge on integrate, test, review and release jobs."
      style="width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px" />
  </div>
</section>
